{"server":"en","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-09_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-09","title":"Cubiculum Obscurum","storyCode":"2-9","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-09_end.txt","sourceHash":"09b2b89ef8162957192174b681fc58c287766a58bd36c1f761b7c78234a016e9","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十一关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_r"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"This is the last wave of pursuers!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"...Aaargh!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"All clear!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Confirming that it's safe over here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Where's the enemy commander?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"...Not with their main force."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"The enemy is lurking... we're being followed and watched."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Are they trying to wear us down until they have the perfect opportunity to strike?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Reunion is no stranger to sneak attacks."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We learned this the hard way at Chernobog."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's fall back quickly..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't guarantee the safety of the escape route."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"We'll be in danger if they start demolishing the nearby buildings to block the road."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Hurry, let's see what other routes we can take. The stealthier, the better!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, how about taking that staircase to our 4 o'clock down?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"That's a difficult route."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Aaargh! Rhodes Island!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It's an ambush! Watch out!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Continue the chase."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't give them any room to breathe."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"There are some Infected kids... still in the slums."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"If possible..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I hope that you can take care of them..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Our duty is to protect Lungmen."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"The Infected are not considered citizens of Lungmen."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"However, citizens or not, the Infected still belong to Lungmen."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"I have no obligation to promise you anything, but I will perform my duty."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"After all..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"They said they used to..."},{"type":"narration","text":"="},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"It's something we've always been doing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Thank you..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you know why we've been searching for you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"...I'm not sure."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't think of any reason why you'd want me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"But I have a feeling..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"That this isn't about me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"...It's about my parents."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"...Yes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Your father was the most famous scientist in Chernobog."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"As well as one of the most important political figures there."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Perhaps, there's something you might know..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"But even if that isn't the case..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"We cannot allow you to fall into Reunion's hands."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"Hehe. I've found you, L.G.D."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't take this personally..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"But I have a very interesting plot in my hands."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"To make things more entertaining, I'll need you all to participate."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"Now, let us begin."},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["Ch'en"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["Misha"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["Franka"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["Liskarm"]},{"speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","aliases":["Skullshatterer"]},{"speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","aliases":["W"]}]}
